Original commit body from 4a7f02b:

Add Rich library for better terminal table formatting:
- Auto-adjusting column widths based on content
- Proper text wrapping for long symbol names and paths
- Colored output for better readability

Add --exclude-tests (-x) flag:
- Filter out symbols from test files without modifying results file
- Allows ephemeral filtering while preserving test nodes for later use

Add --max-per-file N flag:
- Limit symbols shown per file to prevent file domination
- Works with --all to show all files with limited symbols per file
- Useful for browsing diverse codebases

Dependencies:
- Add rich>=13.0 to pyproject.toml
